@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268

### --- PACIENTES (CQRS via MediatR) ---

### GET todos los pacientes
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients
Accept: application/json

###

### GET paciente por ID
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1
Accept: application/json

###

### POST crear paciente (CreatePacienteCommand)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoPaciente": "PAC-0001",
  "tipoDocumento": "DUI",
  "numeroDocumento": "01234567-8",
  "nombres": "Ana",
  "apellidos": "Martinez",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1990-05-14",
  "sexo": "F",
  "estadoCivil": "Soltera",
  "telefono": "+503 7000 0000",
  "telefonoSecundario": null,
  "email": "ana.martinez@example.com",
  "direccion": "San Salvador, Col. Escalón",
  "ciudad": "San Salvador",
  "pais": "El Salvador",
  "ocupacion": "Ingeniera",
  "tipoSangre": "O+",
  "activo": true
}

###

### PUT actualizar paciente (UpdatePacienteCommand)
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigoPaciente": "PAC-0001",
  "tipoDocumento": "DUI",
  "numeroDocumento": "01234567-8",
  "nombres": "Ana María",
  "apellidos": "Martinez López",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1990-05-14",
  "sexo": "F",
  "estadoCivil": "Casada",
  "telefono": "+503 7000 0001",
  "telefonoSecundario": "+503 7000 0002",
  "email": "ana.maria@example.com",
  "direccion": "San Salvador, Col. San Benito",
  "ciudad": "San Salvador",
  "pais": "El Salvador",
  "ocupacion": "Ingeniera Senior",
  "tipoSangre": "O+",
  "activo": true
}

###

### DELETE paciente
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1

###

### --- CONTACTOS DE EMERGENCIA (CQRS) ---

### GET todos los contactos global (ruta absoluta)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/EmergencyContacts
Accept: application/json

###

### GET contactos por paciente
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1/EmergencyContacts
Accept: application/json

###

### POST crear contacto para paciente 1
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1/EmergencyContacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCompleto": "Carlos Martinez",
  "parentesco": "Esposo",
  "telefono": "+503 7777 8888",
  "telefonoSecundario": null,
  "email": "carlos.martinez@example.com",
  "prioridad": 1,
  "activo": true
}

###

### PUT actualizar contacto 1 del paciente 1
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1/EmergencyContacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCompleto": "Carlos Martinez López",
  "parentesco": "Esposo",
  "telefono": "+503 7777 9999",
  "telefonoSecundario": "+503 7777 8888",
  "email": "carlos.lopez@example.com",
  "prioridad": 1,
  "activo": true
}

###

### DELETE contacto 1 del paciente 1
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1/EmergencyContacts/1

###
